Package: potentiomap
Title: Build Potentiometric Surfaces and Flow Arrows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Elvin", "Cordero", email = "elvin.cordero@seamountgeo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Elvin Cordero [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Elvin Cordero <elvin.cordero@seamountgeo.com>
Description: Tools for preparing groundwater elevation observations from
    depth-to-water data, surface elevation rasters or point measurements,
    interpolating potentiometric surfaces with several methods, exporting
    rasters and contours, and generating hydraulic-gradient flow arrows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/el-cordero/potentiomap
BugReports: https://github.com/el-cordero/potentiomap/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
